          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.9,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "because if you throw an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 100.02000000000001,
          "en": "no error code after throwing that error will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.02000000000001,
          "end": 102.3,
          "en": "Now here I don't wanna throw my own error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.3,
          "end": 104.49000000000001,
          "en": "but it's worth knowing that this feature exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.49000000000001,
          "end": 107.19,
          "en": "and that you can generate such an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.19,
          "end": 109.02600000000001,
          "en": "But why would you do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.02600000000001,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "Well, because you might wanna communicate that something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
