        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.76,
          "end": 195.72,
          "en": "catches any error that might've been thrown by the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.72,
          "end": 198.363,
          "en": "between those try curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.2,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "You then get access to the error here by wrapping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 206.85,
          "en": "any variable name of your choice between parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.85,
          "end": 211.17000000000002,
          "en": "and adding another pair of curly braces opening and closing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "So this error thing here is in the end a variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "that's created automatically by dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 218.623,
          "en": "and you can give it any name of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.623,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "whenever this code here between those try curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "causes an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 227.64,
          "en": "And this is then simply this exceptional object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.64,
          "end": 230.55,
          "en": "which I showed you before with throw.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 233.13,
          "en": "So this exceptional object which you can create,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.13,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "that's the error you are getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 237.39,
          "en": "when catching such an exception.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.39,
          "end": 240.69,
          "en": "And this error object could contain useful information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.69,
          "end": 243.647,
          "en": "like for example, a more detailed error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.647,
          "end": 246.57,
          "en": "and you can then add your fallback code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.57,
          "end": 249.69,
          "en": "that should be executed when an error occurs here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.69,
          "end": 251.46,
          "en": "in this catch block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.46,
          "end": 255.51,
          "en": "And thereafter, the app will resume in a normal way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.51,
          "end": 258.84,
          "en": "Therefore, here I will actually wrap all this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.84,
          "end": 260.58,
          "en": "where I transform the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.58,
          "end": 264.63,
          "en": "load the data, and so on with this try block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 264.63,
          "end": 268.158,
          "en": "So I'll cut it and add it here instead of try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.158,
          "end": 270.67,
          "en": "So that I try executing all this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
