        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 283.655,
          "en": "as I do it here in case of an error response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.655,
          "end": 286.89,
          "en": "But now I'll do it inside of catch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 286.89,
          "end": 288.813,
          "en": "And here we can then say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.89,
          "end": 292.803,
          "en": "something went wrong, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.63,
          "end": 299.46,
          "en": "And if we do that and we now still have this broken URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
